    "about.kicker": "About Me",
    "about.title": "My Design Philosophy",
    "about.p1": "I am an architecture graduate with a Master's degree in Urban Design, passionate about creating sustainable and people-centred environments. I hold a Master of Urban Design from Newcastle University, United Kingdom (2025\u20132026), and a Bachelor of Architecture from Bah\u00e7e\u015fhir University, Turkey (2021\u20132025).",
    "about.p2": "Through academic and professional experience at Ryder Architecture, MawsonKerr, and Architenko Brussels, I have developed skills in architectural design, urban masterplanning, landscape integration, site analysis, spatial planning, 3D modelling, and visualisation. Alongside my design background, freelance work in digital marketing and content creation has strengthened my communication and presentation skills. I am particularly interested in the relationship between people, place, and the built environment, with a focus on creating meaningful and resilient spaces.",
